Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add agent support: transcripts, validation, identity,
 scripted faux

- Transcript: system-message replay, tool state changes, and tool support
  levels; Transform.normalize resolves transcript tool declarations per model
- Validation: tool-argument coercion and checks through the typebox shard
- ClientIdentity: User-Agent and provider attribution headers
- StreamOptions: api_key, session_id, thinking_budgets, max_retry_delay_ms,
  identity; StreamHooks#on_provider_event
- ToolResultMessage: details and usage; copy_with on messages and options
- AbortHandle: reason, listeners, throw_if_aborted
- FauxProvider.scripted: queued responses for tests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
